abstract: "Code and data to reproduce an exploratory analysis of the online popularity (Google Trends), e-commerce presence (Mercado Livre) and pharmaceutical registry (ANVISA) of the 71 species of the Brazilian national list of medicinal plants of interest to the public health system (RENISUS). Data licensing is described in LICENSE-data.md."
